OL,3,GNEWSANew gritter and bin lorry depot to
OL,4,Acost #13m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA contract to build a new council depot
OL,7,Fto store bin lorries, gritters and
OL,8,Ftonnes of salt is expected to cost
OL,9,F#13m.
OL,11,FSunderland City Council wants to
OL,12,Freplace its Houghton-le-Spring depot at
OL,13,FMarket Place Industrial Estate with a
OL,14,Fnew site on Cygnet Way at Rainton
OL,15,FBridge Business Park.
OL,17,FThe Reform-led authority said its
OL,18,Fcurrent facility was "not fit for
OL,19,Fpurpose" and not replacing it would
OL,20,Fpresent "a significant risk" to
OL,21,Fdelivery of its services.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
