OL,3,GNEWSANew gritter and bin lorry depot to
OL,4,Acost #13m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report published ahead of a cabinet
OL,7,Fmeeting on Wednesday recommended the
OL,8,Fcouncil agrees to award the contract
OL,9,Ffor the project to its preferred
OL,10,Fbidder, chosen among eight firms that
OL,11,Fput themselves forward. The firm has
OL,12,Fnot yet been named publicly.
